---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Jobs Nation"
  description="Jobs Nation Privacy Policy. Learn how we handle your resume data, job search preferences, and protect your privacy."
>
  <div class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 prose prose-slate">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-8">Last updated: September 26, 2026</p>

      <section class="space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          Jobs Nation collects information to provide verified direct-to-company job opportunities and personalized search tools.
          This includes:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>Contact Information:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, and location.</li>
          <li><strong>Professional Profile & Resume:</strong> Work history, skills, portfolio links, GitHub, LinkedIn URLs, and resumes you upload.</li>
          <li><strong>Payment Information:</strong> Processed directly and securely by our certified PCI-DSS Level 1 compliant Merchant of Record. We do not store raw credit card numbers on our servers.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
        <p>
          We use your data strictly to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li>Match your background with active direct company ATS listings (Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby, Workday).</li>
          <li>Help you organize, bookmark, and track your direct applications to company career sites.</li>
          <li>Synthesize customized cover letters and screening responses using Jobs Nation AI tools.</li>
          <li>Process billing transactions and subscription passes through our authorized Merchant of Record.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">3. AI Processing & Matching Architecture</h2>
        <p>
          Jobs Nation leverages enterprise neural NLP algorithms to analyze resume compatibility and formulate screening responses. Your resumes and profile data are processed within secure, enterprise-grade cloud environments and are <em>never used to train public third-party foundation models</em>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">4. Third-Party Integrations</h2>
        <p>
          We partner with leading providers to power our platform:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>Merchant of Record & Payment Infrastructure:</strong> Handles global merchant of record billing, sales tax, VAT, and customer subscription management.</li>
          <li><strong>Jobs Nation AI Engine:</strong> Powers semantic resume extraction, match score computation, and cover letter generation.</li>
          <li><strong>Direct Company ATS Boards:</strong> We index verified direct career sites and navigate you to employer application forms.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">5. Data Retention & Deletion</h2>
        <p>
          You may request complete deletion of your resume, account history, and application logs at any time by contacting our support team at <a href="mailto:support@jobsnation.co" class="text-blue-600 underline">support@jobsnation.co</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
